    "created_at": "2016-11-28T16:52:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-28T16:52:20Z",
    "body": "It's defined to be an opaque origin, AFAICT\r\n\r\nhttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-origin\r\n\r\nBut is should be the `template` element's [node document](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document)'s origin, right?",
