    "created_at": "2016-11-29T14:59:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-29T14:59:10Z",
    "body": "It seems like it also inherits URL in Gecko, but not in Chrome. This actually results in URL parsing differences for descendants.\r\n\r\nEncoding and mode do not get copied in either.\r\n\r\nAgreed that it should just be the origin of _doc_ in the algorithm that creates this document.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
